<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - March 25.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - March 25.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* ANZ Banking Group Ltd A$8.28 (+0.18)</p>
<p>* Westpac Banking Corp Ltd A$7.49 (+0.21)</p>
<p>Bank shares again seen the focus of merger speculation as official report into banking regulation, Wallis report, is due to be released early next week.</p>
<p>* Century Drilling A$1.27 (-0.05)</p>
<p>Downer Group Australia Pty Ltd, a unit of Paul Y-Construction Holdings Ltd, said on Tuesday it had raised its takeover offer for drilling contractor Century Drilling Ltd to A$1.60 a share from A$1.02 per share.</p>
<p>* RTZ Corp Plc-CRA Ltd A$18.24 (-0.07)</p>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson upgraded their earnings forecasts for RTZ-CRA and repeated a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>* News Corp Ltd A$6.16 (+0.132)</p>
<p>Shortcovering seen in News Corp trade on Monday as J.B. Were seen as active buyer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
